  },
  "Shifts": {
    "_Comment_Shifts": "2 operational shifts: 1st Shift (scheduled ~11:30 AM) and 2nd Shift (scheduled ~7:30 PM / 19:30). The job determines the shift automatically based on execution time. No shift details are stored in Excel or passed as CLI arguments.",
